2504:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** /**
2505:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\fun  Set the reset trigger of a timer counter.
2506:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\note The reset of the timer counter can be triggered by up to 30 events
2507:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c ****  *       that can be selected among the following sources:
2508:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\        - The timing unit: Compare 2, Compare 4 and Update (3 events).
2509:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\        - The master timer: Reset and Compare 1..4 (5 events).
2510:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\        - The external events EXTEVNT1..10 (10 events).
2511:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\        - All other timing units (e.g. Timer B..F for timer A): Compare 1, 2 and 4 (12 events).
2512:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\param  SHRTIMx Super High Resolution Timer instance
2513:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\param  Timer This parameter can be one of the following values:
2514:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\        - SHRTIM_TIMER_A
2515:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\        - SHRTIM_TIMER_B
