3907:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\fun  Select Fault and Event roll-over mode.
3908:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\note Only significant in up-down counting mode (see function SHRTIM_TIM_SetCountingMode()).
3909:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_shrtim.c **** *\*\note only concerns the Roll-over event used by the Fault and Event counters.
